/**
 * Bulk-import the real uMod (Oxide/Carbon) Rust plugin catalogue into
 * `GameMod` — closes the gap the 2026-09-24 audit found: `rust` has only 29
 * hand-seeded uMod rows today while uMod's own public JSON API exposes
 * ~1,419 real Rust plugins. `scripts/verify-gamemods.ts` currently believes
 * uMod has no public API at all (its file header says so) — it does; this
 * script is the real one.
